    "detailed_description": "Conflict of Lords is an Roguelite Anti-TD game. You will act as the Lord of Foe in Game Development Council, who decided to go his separate way due to a conflict. Invade the newly released game Village Guardian. Summon the Predators to destroy villages. Try your best to overthrow the Overlord!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Destroyer</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/da451688475afa6ad0f0bf4eead86a71.poster.avif?t=1735006502\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/da451688475afa6ad0f0bf4eead86a71.webm?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/da451688475afa6ad0f0bf4eead86a71.mp4?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Lord of Foe can cost energy to summon predators to attack the village. It can also cast powerful spells to paralyze enemies, focus on specific target, deal area damage\u2026<br><br>As powerful as the Lord of Foe is, it also has to play by the rules. While advancing on a fixed route, if Lord\u2019s HP goes to 0, the game will come to an end. Summon your army to protect the Lord of Foe! <br><br>The hero avatars of mob players will randomly respawn in the battlefield and try to protect the village. Show them your powe!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One More Round</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/d6cf6902e4445cc5eb2cc961d5c3a0ff.poster.avif?t=1735006502\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/d6cf6902e4445cc5eb2cc961d5c3a0ff.webm?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/d6cf6902e4445cc5eb2cc961d5c3a0ff.mp4?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Clear stages and you can get new units, equipment, and skills. Make your own build with various units and an equipment. Every round is a different experience<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vivid Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/2ab0f61fc84e60e313a05111c88bf6bd.poster.avif?t=1735006502\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/2ab0f61fc84e60e313a05111c88bf6bd.webm?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/2ab0f61fc84e60e313a05111c88bf6bd.mp4?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lords of the Game Development Council can always work together and bring marvellous games to the players\u2026\u2026 Do they? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/52b8d3c536c8d976baa6ac68ccae2b0c.poster.avif?t=1735006502\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/52b8d3c536c8d976baa6ac68ccae2b0c.webm?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577520/extras/52b8d3c536c8d976baa6ac68ccae2b0c.mp4?t=1735006502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Variety of players: Rude Mage, Arrogant Archer and Wordy Warrior. It seems that they have their secrets?<br><br>Time to teach those players a lesson with the Lord\u2019s power.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rougelite + Anti-TD + Auto Chess <br></li><li>2D, bright cartoon art<br></li><li>Metastory</li></ul>",
